    "updated_at": "2017-10-31T21:47:50Z",
    "body": "We'll try to fix this ASAP. Sorry to put everyone through this.\r\n\r\nTo help us understand: this problem would also occur with a same-origin window, right? It's just bad luck that the code in question is only passing cross-origin windows and expecting them to work?",
